    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "team_0050_botan_11",
      "hash64": "B1BDF539D0C31DB4",
      "text": "... Tu sais, j’ai entendu des rumeurs à leur sujet.\\nIl paraît qu’au fond, ils ne sont pas si méchants...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 104,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "team_0050_botan_12",
      "hash64": "B1BDF839D0C322CD",
      "text": "La plupart d’entre eux auraient été des victimes\\nde harcèlement, ou auraient tout simplement\\r\\ndu mal à gérer les interactions sociales...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 139,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "team_0050_botan_13",
      "hash64": "B1BDF739D0C3211A",
      "text": "Ils se seraient alors rassemblés pour former\\nla Team Star...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "team_0050_botan_14",
      "hash64": "B1BDF239D0C3189B",
      "text": "Tout seul, c’est dur de lutter contre\\nle harcèlement... Mais à plusieurs...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "team_0050_botan_15",
      "hash64": "B1BDF139D0C316E8",
      "text": "Ah ! Je... J’ai lu tout ça sur le réseau social privé\\ndes élèves. J’ai piraté l’un des comptes...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "team_0050_botan_16",
      "hash64": "B1BDF439D0C31C01",
      "text": "J’ai aussi lu qu’il y aurait quelqu’un au-dessus des\\nboss, et qui serait le cerveau derrière tout ça...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 103,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "team_0050_botan_17",
      "hash64": "B1BDF339D0C31A4E",
      "text": "... Hum... Je n’ai pas autant parlé depuis\\nlongtemps... J’ai la gorge toute sèche...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
